Package: V8n
Type: Package
Title: Embedded JavaScript and WebAssembly Engine for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jan Marvin", "Garbuszus", role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "jan.garbuszus@ruhr-uni-bochum.de"),
    person("Jeroen", "Ooms", role = c("aut", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4035-0289", note = "author of the V8 package")))
Description: An R interface to V8 <https://v8.dev>: Google's open source
    JavaScript and WebAssembly engine. A fork of the 'V8' package that copies
    values directly between R vectors and JavaScript typed arrays instead of
    converting them to JSON text.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/JanMarvin/V8n
BugReports: https://github.com/JanMarvin/V8n/issues
SystemRequirements: V8 11.3 or newer: libnode-dev (Debian, Ubuntu) or v8-devel
    (Fedora). On most other platforms a static libv8 is downloaded during the
    installation, see the README for details.
NeedsCompilation: yes
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 0.12.12),
    utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    jsonlite (>= 1.0),
    testthat,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Roxygen: list(load = "installed", markdown = TRUE)
